@AbuDhabiDMT
 has partnered with real estate developer Eagle Hills to transform selected development areas into community destinations across Abu Dhabi through community-oriented experiences to enhance urban dynamics and quality of life in the emirate.

The 
@ZayedCharityRun
 will take place in Europe for the first time, in Budapest, Hungary, on 16 and 17 May 2026. Organised by the UAE Embassy in Budapest, the two-day event will celebrate kindness, health, solidarity, and cultural connection through sport.

The second activation of the Where Life Pulses initiative, organised by 
@DCDAbuDhabi
 in Zakher, Al Ain Region, welcomed more than 6,000 visitors, showcasing community spirit through youth entrepreneurship, creative workshops, cultural activations, and family-focused activities.
